WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.635 --> 00:00:07.880
So a while back we built a table out of snow

00:00:09.177 --> 00:00:10.398
and let it freeze overnight.

00:00:10.911 --> 00:00:13.992
Today it's time to find out who's the king of the ice&nbsp;
table.

00:00:14.442 --> 00:00:15.729
Official king of the table draw.

00:00:16.828 --> 00:00:17.813
Ok you start.

00:00:27.197 --> 00:00:27.850
Roller chop.

00:00:45.056 --> 00:00:47.238
No! A bit of sidespin in the shot.

00:00:50.353 --> 00:00:51.086
Good serve!

00:00:53.682 --> 00:00:54.182
Oh no!

00:00:55.926 --> 00:00:58.169
I couldn't see anything my hat was above my eyes.

00:00:58.169 --> 00:00:59.046
You lost the point.

00:00:59.046 --> 00:01:00.268
I wanna see the video replay.

00:01:01.576 --> 00:01:03.111
Yeah okay it was on.

00:01:04.776 --> 00:01:07.115
Interesting change of conditions here.

00:01:07.115 --> 00:01:09.309
Now it's really started to snow.

00:01:19.895 --> 00:01:20.587
Good rally!

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:43.599
Had to go for the hard one.

00:01:53.889 --> 00:01:55.234
Why is looping so hard?

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:56.640
You&nbsp;should just play it safe.

00:02:07.751 --> 00:02:08.566
Uuuuh nice one!

00:02:09.424 --> 00:02:09.924
Come on!

00:02:16.960 --> 00:02:19.158
I was so ready for the forehand around the net.

00:02:19.158 --> 00:02:20.160
Yeah I saw.

00:02:57.581 --> 00:02:59.113
Nooo you got the low one.

00:03:00.097 --> 00:03:01.920
Okay I need to start my comeback.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.799
That's a proper way to start your comeback!

00:03:11.799 --> 00:03:14.633
You&nbsp;still haven't learnt through all these years

00:03:14.633 --> 00:03:16.625
that don't give me there!

00:03:16.625 --> 00:03:18.355
That's the biggest&nbsp;mistake you can make.

00:03:18.355 --> 00:03:19.427
But you still do it.

00:03:38.189 --> 00:03:39.336
Noooo!

00:03:39.336 --> 00:03:40.986
Was it still in play?

00:03:40.986 --> 00:03:42.676
Yeah it was!

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:44.297
That was rally of the day!

00:03:44.297 --> 00:03:46.316
Yeah of course I went for the big forehand!

00:03:48.241 --> 00:03:50.442
No I can't keep...

00:03:53.697 --> 00:03:55.060
Nice! That was smooth!

00:04:17.592 --> 00:04:18.739
Noooo!

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:22.031
This is probably the best&nbsp;reflex training there is.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.560 --> 00:04:24.527
Otto's reaction was really&nbsp;good.

00:04:24.527 --> 00:04:26.082
Good comeback so far.

00:04:52.557 --> 00:04:54.071
That was crazy forehand!

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.403
Whoah!

00:05:01.596 --> 00:05:03.395
That was literally impossible to get.

00:05:13.693 --> 00:05:14.301
Chole!

00:05:16.237 --> 00:05:18.359
It touched? Did it touch?

00:05:19.124 --> 00:05:20.320
Oooh that was nice!

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:26.664
Sneaky

00:05:27.365 --> 00:05:28.514
No again!

00:05:40.276 --> 00:05:40.995
Come on!

00:05:42.345 --> 00:05:43.294
Ooh that was good!

00:05:58.320 --> 00:05:58.935
Nouh!

00:05:59.155 --> 00:05:59.879
Match point!

00:06:05.767 --> 00:06:06.267
Yes!

00:06:06.267 --> 00:06:07.486
Noo went for the big one.

00:06:23.827 --> 00:06:25.507
Both playing it very safe.

00:06:30.188 --> 00:06:30.909
Good save.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.187
Your knee down tactic didn't&nbsp;work.

00:06:38.187 --> 00:06:39.731
Oh it's another match point to Emil.

00:06:46.974 --> 00:06:48.740
Yes! Come on!

00:06:51.583 --> 00:06:52.591
Winner!

00:06:52.591 --> 00:06:55.675
Winner of the ice edition king of the table!

00:06:56.356 --> 00:06:57.584
Good match! Good match!

00:06:57.584 --> 00:06:59.361
Thanks&nbsp;for watching, until next time!

